      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I wouldn't recommend adding extra caffeine or high-dose caffeine pills to your routine. While caffeine can temporarily boost focus and energy, excessive consumption can lead to jitters, anxiety, insomnia, and increased heart rate. It may also interact with your prescribed Ritalin, potentially reducing its effectiveness or causing adverse side effects. Consult your doctor or a medical professional for guidance on managing your ADHD symptoms and preparing for finals week.",
